flowchart TD
  U[Upload file] --> DAPI[/api/v1/documents/upload]
  DAPI --> EXTRACT[PDF/OCR extraction]
  EXTRACT --> SAVE[Persist metadata]
  SAVE --> CHUNK[Chunk + embed]
  CHUNK --> IDX[FAISS write by scope]
  IDX --> JOB[index_jobs status]
  JOB --> HEALTH[kb health/smoke endpoints]
  HEALTH --> UI[Documents + Matter Dashboard]
